<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God hath us regenerated</l><l>In our spirit with His life;</l><l>But He must transform us further—</l><l>In our soul by His own life.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Spreading outward from our spirit</l><l>Doth the Lord transform our soul,</l><l>By the inward parts renewing,</l><l>Till within His full control.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>By the power of His Spirit</l><l>In His pattern He transforms;</l><l>From His glory to His glory</l><l>To His image He conforms.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>He transforms, all sanctifying,</l><l>Till like Him we are matured;</l><l>He transforms, our soul possessing,</l><l>Till His stature is secured.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
